8495+ 834B              ; NZ/NC = HL available data (clamped to download_length).
8496+ 834B              ; Z/NC = closed socket with no queued bytes; Z/C = user pressed B.
8497+ 834B              ; Temporary emptiness is paced and retried, never treated as EOF.
8498+ 834B              ; Empty polls wait until data, confirmed closure or B; AT query replies remain bounded.
